{"seq":10,"slug":"information-technology","title":"高一信息科技","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":13,"url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology","introMarkdown":"# 高一信息科技 简介\n\n高一信息科技课程帮助学生从技术使用者转变为技术理解者和创造者。在数字化时代，仅仅会使用计算机和互联网是不够的——理解算法如何解决问题、网络如何安全运行、数据如何驱动创新，才能真正具备适应数字社会的核心素养。高一信息科技以编程基础、网络安全和数字创新三个维度，建立信息技术的认知框架和实践能力。\n\n本知识库面向高一年级学生，内容遵循新课标信息技术课程的核心模块。全书共分三章，从程序设计的基本思维到网络与安全的实用知识再到数字技术的创新应用，构成递进式的信息素养培养体系。\n\n第一章**编程基础**从算法的概念和表示方法入手，讲解 Python 程序设计的基本语法、顺序结构、选择结构和循环结构，以及函数和基本数据结构的使用，帮助学生建立用计算思维分析和解决问题的能力。第二章**网络与安全**讲解计算机网络的基本架构、互联网的工作原理和常见网络协议，分析网络安全威胁的类型和防范措施，培养学生安全、负责任地使用网络的意识和能力。第三章**数字创新**介绍数据处理与可视化的基本方法、人工智能的入门概念，以及数字化工具在学习和生活中的创新应用，激发学生运用信息技术解决实际问题的创造力。\n\n推荐按章节顺序学习。编程基础是理解一切信息技术的思维工具，网络安全知识为数字生活提供保障，数字创新则将前两章知识综合运用于实际场景。学习中要注重动手实践，编程必须通过写代码来掌握，不能只看不练。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-fundamentals","title":"编程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/programming-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algorithms-basics","title":"高一信息技术 — 算法基础与流程图","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/programming-fundamentals/algorithms-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"python-basics","title":"高一信息技术 — Python基础","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/programming-fundamentals/python-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-structures-intro","title":"高一信息技术 — 数据结构入门","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/programming-fundamentals/data-structures-intro"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-security","title":"网络与安全","docCount":3,"url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/network-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-basics","title":"高一信息技术 — 网络基础","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/network-security/network-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cybersecurity","title":"高一信息技术 — 网络安全","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/network-security/cybersecurity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-protection","title":"高一信息技术 — 数据保护","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/network-security/data-protection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-innovation","title":"数字创新","docCount":3,"url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/digital-innovation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-introduction","title":"高一信息技术 — 人工智能入门","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/digital-innovation/ai-introduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"big-data","title":"高一信息技术 — 大数据概论","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/digital-innovation/big-data"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iot-robotics","title":"高一信息技术 — 物联网与机器人","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/digital-innovation/iot-robotics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-usage","title":"AI 使用","docCount":4,"url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/ai-usage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-prompt-engineering","title":"Untitled","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/ai-usage/what-is-prompt-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-prompts","title":"Untitled","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/ai-usage/structured-prompts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"examples-driven-prompting","title":"Untitled","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/ai-usage/examples-driven-prompting"},{"seq":4,"slug":"debugging-bad-outputs","title":"Untitled","url":"/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/ai-usage/debugging-bad-outputs"}]}]}